"login":"tchaikov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kyrie112/ceph_cls_dev/commits/928aa98c1dcac36aabb29913fc78479bcfd6d2c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-20T23:09:11Z","email":"tchaikov@gmail.com","name":"Kefu Chai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-21T08:57:34Z","email":"tchaikov@gmail.com","name":"Kefu Chai"},"message":"auth: remove unused AuthTicket::renew_after member variable\n\nThe AuthTicket::renew_after field is only set in init_timestamps() and\nread by dump() for debugging purposes. It has no functional use cases\nand causes encoding/decoding inconsistencies.\n\nDuring decoding, this field remains unchanged, creating discrepancies\nbetween original and decoded values. This issue was masked because\ncheck-generated.sh and readable.sh reused struct instances, preserving\nstale field values across encode/decode cycles.\n\nAn upcoming change will allocate fresh instances for each decode\noperation, which would expose these inconsistent values.\n\nRemove the unused field to eliminate the encoding inconsistency and\nsimplify the codebase.\n\nSigned-off-by: Kefu Chai <tchaikov@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"493cc0db51e24546ed5392db89487c3816c833da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kyrie112/ceph_cls_dev/git/trees/493cc0db51e24546ed5392db89487c3816c833da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kyrie112/ceph_cls_dev/git/commits/928aa98c1dcac36aabb29913fc78479bcfd6d2c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":fals