9:00Z","email":"rfriedma@redhat.com","name":"Ronen Friedman"},"message":"osd/scrub: allow auto-repair on operator-initiated scrubs\n\nPreviously, operator-initiated scrubs would not auto-repair, regardless\nof the value of the ''osd_scrub_auto_repair'' config option.  This was\nless confusing to the operator than it could have been, as most\noperator commands would in fact cause a regular periodic scrub\nto be initiated. However, that quirk is now fixed: operator commands\nnow trigger ''op-initiated'' scrubs. Thus the need for this patch.\n\nThe original bug was fixed in https://github.com/ceph/ceph/pull/54615,\nbut was unfortunately re-introduced later on.\nFixes: https://tracker.ceph.com/issues/72178\n\nSigned-off-by: Ronen Friedman <rfriedma@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"6442f39b381e59ffdb1ba10d39fb62e2ae763cfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kyrie112/ceph_cls_dev/git/trees/6442f39b381e59ffdb1ba10d39fb62e2ae763cfe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kyrie112/ceph_cls_dev/git/commits/97de817ad1c253ee1c7c9c9302981ad2435301b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49867032?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ronen-fr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ronen-fr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ronen-fr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ronen-fr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ronen-fr","id":49867032,"login":"ronen-fr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODY3MDMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ronen-fr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ronen-fr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ronen-fr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ronen-fr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ronen-fr/su