,"user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kyrie112/ceph_cls_dev/commits/49c0fd0d136d1d37d08cfc1e96ddf48c74474ec1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-16T08:21:20Z","email":"14869000+bluikko@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ville Ojamo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-16T09:02:24Z","email":"14869000+bluikko@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ville Ojamo"},"message":"doc/radosgw: Small improvements in s3_objects_dedup.rst\n\nFix sentence that had \"different same\" to just \"different\" (verified the\nright one from the original author).\n\nRemove colon at the end of section titles.\n\nRemove rendered horizontal lines between sections.\n\nUse double backticks for command name.\n\nUse regular apostrophe in one sentence to be consistent with the rest.\n\nAdd missing full stop at the end of several sentences.\n\nVery small language improvements in a few sentences.\n\nUse consistent indent in one line.\n\nRemove hyphens from many word pairs and don''t capitalize few terms.\nFor consistency with rest of the docs.\n\nFix typos \"spliting\" to \"splitting\", \"underlined\" to \"underlying\".\n\nSpell out \"thousands\" instead of using an apostrophe after the number.\n\nReformat table to use row separators like rest of the docs instead of\nempty columns.\nSeparate number and unit with a space. Remove rendered underscores that\nseemed to be an attempt to imprecisely align cell contents to right.\n\nSigned-off-by: Ville Ojamo <14869000+bluikko@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0f451f4b9b8fb6d32f2b8172200217c29be2c79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kyrie112/ceph_cls_dev/git/trees/e0f451f4b9b8fb6d32f2b8172200217c29be2c79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kyrie112/ceph_cls_dev/git/commits/49c0fd0d136d1d37d08cfc1e96ddf48c74474ec1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14869000