commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-28T04:33:06Z","email":"jonathan@awellhealth.com","name":"JB"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-28T04:33:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #28 from awell-health/medplum\n\nMedplum integration + SMART on FHIR launch\n\n- **What**: Adds Medplum integration and a minimal SMART on FHIR launch flow to surface authenticated patient tasks in Navi Portal.\n\n- **Key changes**\n  - **Medplum**: Introduces `MedplumClientProvider`, `medplum-client.ts`, and `actions.ts` for patient task retrieval and session handling.\n  - **SMART flow**: Adds `smart/launch` and `smart/callback` routes, plus `smart/home` and a short `smart/README.md`.\n  - **UI**: Adds `components/tasks/task-list.tsx` to render patient tasks.\n  - **EHR domain**: Adds `domains/smart/ehr.ts` to encapsulate SMART/EHR interactions.\n  - **Config**: Updates `env.ts`, `package.json`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`, and `turbo.json`; adds `scripts/tsconfig.json` and updates CI env script.\n\n- **Impact**\n  - Changes are scoped to Medplum/SMART; existing flows remain unaffected.\n  - Introduces new env vars for Medplum and SMART configuration via `env.ts`.\n\n- **Docs**\n  - Minimal guidance in `apps/navi-portal/src/app/smart/README.md`.\n\nIf you want this tailored to a specific PR template, share its sections and I’ll align the wording.","tree":{"sha":"02bd5603862abb0a7d081137512022f8ac553377","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/navi/git/trees/02bd5603862abb0a7d081137512022f8ac553377"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awell-health/navi/git/commits/f695efa447074b98b2a96a2c316a37d5d1ce4990","verification":{"payload":"tree 02bd5603862abb0a7d081137512022f8ac553377\nparent 50d682cf7c6c34776ebbb63c4295e631e0e95625\nparent 6e481911aae0da250b23b0436a9826742291e749\nauthor JB <jonathan@awellhealth.com> 1756355586 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1756355586 -0700\n\nMerge pull request #28 from awell-health/medplum\n\nMedplum integration + SMART on FHIR launch\n\n- **What**: Adds Medplum integration and a minimal SMART on FHIR launch flow to surface authenticated patient tasks in Navi Portal.\n\n- **Key changes**\n  - **Medplum**: Introduces `MedplumClientProvider`, `medplum-client.ts`, and `actions.ts` for patient task retrieval and session handling.\n  - **SMART flow**: Adds `smart/launch` and `smart/callback` routes, plus `smart/home` and a short `smart/README.md`.\n  - **UI**: Adds `components/tasks/task-list.tsx` to render patient tasks.\n  - **EHR domain**: Adds `domains/smart/ehr.ts` to encapsulate SMART/EHR interactions.\n  - **Config**: Updates `env.ts`, `package.json`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`, and `turbo.json`; adds `scripts/tsconfig.json` and updates CI env script.\n\n- **Impact**\n  - Changes are scoped to Medplum/SMART; existing flows remain unaffected.\n  - Introduces new env vars for Medplum and SMART configuration via `env.ts`.\n\n- **Docs**\n  - Minimal guidance in `apps/navi-portal/src/app/smart/README.md`.\n\nIf you want this tailored to a specific PR template, share its sections and I’ll align the wording.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJor9wCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACTgQADXU3n6mHQr3u282BEGlTFIx\niAKE2Bz8T7OfPGS+DOMz3OFVlW1bAmsk/Z+yR/zW8ugohYdfyPnqQUwNfWxNebh2\nPI2tWT6R+JnRyNChiKeDd7NaN2ID8zY7rinLcUqpUoXS+wa6Q5epjixWSoaCO4LN\ntpqtq8kc46tPGg44KFRDCG1BxlGvBOKlLQ/1pNV0G/QA9YbphoQAk062Jyi19NN6\n39L0O2j1+7ZvCcYqIzeTLih0u7w2neW5HF0yVv9oMQesyh4ivInCSykWpSqof0fX\n/E6FNDL80UVL6SzLkLJmm0MjosI4JF6nWEj2p8GNY6YqJpBygc2zhmguJTlqGEka\nOPoBPdetWv5RksQjAto9mulIKelB39EI/gpNK+dK/YCohT91hUPlBdOsJqdCPLds\n/7kSYp8IYOVHo45TlpoM3fxHDgHzjWtEkYHXkPjFD8E1qGvo5k/pMcNgok3D7JnG\nLqX32q3tO9F8gA0KSd++9+jGLVJMbvOGutH+67wQ10rOkIXshE+Tjg9/ryVJ5oFb\n504GrinJNDbAi839RD03Jg7RO/PaPKq31A1ZjwnYcQk8b1D98MFVq9u13QbDpLGi\nXvVTs0g37CXix2zRs6v/oa1ECV+k74J06/J9QvQ2su0YwW29danGae0CmDJhWFpH\ny4LeF6Vyig10vDdBISzL\n=QGyy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_a