ttps://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/commit/e21a00207d8190b5e308f9bca6e7d8939162f54d","node_id":"C_kwDOO8KSo9oAKGUyMWEwMDIwN2Q4MTkwYjVlMzA4ZjliY2E2ZTdkODkzOTE2MmY1NGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/commit/982b37950ba1d2c94b45ef6a40f365828243d2be","sha":"982b37950ba1d2c94b45ef6a40f365828243d2be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/commits/982b37950ba1d2c94b45ef6a40f365828243d2be"}],"sha":"e21a00207d8190b5e308f9bca6e7d8939162f54d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/commits/e21a00207d8190b5e308f9bca6e7d8939162f54d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1676151?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcocastellani","id":1676151,"login":"marcocastellani","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzYxNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/commits/982b37950ba1d2c94b45ef6a40f365828243d2be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-28T19:19:58Z","email":"marcocastellani@hotmail.com","name":"Marco Castellani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-28T19:19:58Z","email":"marcocastellani@hotmail.com","name":"Marco Castellani"},"message":"fix(frontend): resolve section ID conversion and type mismatch errors\n\n🚨 ISSUES FIXED:\n1. Section ID conversion error - Guid? type mismatch\n2. Frontend/backend DTO property mismatches\n3. ''Command field required'' validation error\n\nROOT CAUSE:\n- Frontend sending temporary section IDs instead of undefined for new sections\n- Frontend type definitions didn''t match backend DTO requirements\n- Required fields marked as optional in frontend types\n\nSOLUTIONS:\n1. Apply same temp ID fix to sections (startsWith(''temp-'') → undefined)\n2. Update UpdateSectionRequest to match backend UpdateSectionDto:\n   - title: required (was optional)\n   - order: required (was optional)\n   - isDeleted: added (was missing)\n3. Update UpdateQuestionRequest to match backend UpdateQuestionDto:\n   - title → text (property name change)\n   - questionType → type (property name change)\n   - description → helpText (property name change)\n   - Add missing fields: allowDocumentUpload, maxDocuments, requireDocuments, isDeleted\n   - Make required fields actually required\n\nThis should resolve both the Guid conversion errors and validation failures.\nRelates to: US-B1-014 CRITICAL bug fixes","tree":{"sha":"4a4c245ae3e82bfddd7b090998567579e0a87399","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/git/trees/4a4c245ae3e82bfddd7b090998567579e0a87399"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/git/commits/982b37950ba1d2c94b45ef6a40f365828243d2be","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a4c245ae3e82bfddd7b090998567579e0a87399\nparent d27a900ee8eabba82e55ab2fd570b32591358fe2\nauthor Marco Castellani <marcocastellani@hotmail.com> 1751138398 +0200\ncommitter Marco Castellani <marcocastellani@hotmail.com> 1751138398 +0200\n\nfix(frontend): resolve section ID conversion and type mismatch errors\n\n🚨 ISSUES FIXED:\n1. Section ID conversion error - Guid? type mismatch\n2. Frontend/backend DTO property mismatches\n3. ''Command field required'' validation error\n\nROOT CAUSE:\n- Frontend sending temporary section IDs instead of undefined for new sections\n- Frontend type definitions didn''t match backend DTO requirements\n- Required fields marked as optional in frontend types\n\nSOLUTIONS:\n1. Apply same temp ID fix to sections (startsWith(''temp-'') → undefined)\n2. Update UpdateSectionRequest to match backend UpdateSectionDto:\n   - title: required (was optional)\n   - order: required (was optional)\n   - isDeleted: added (was missing)\n3. Update UpdateQuestionRequest to match backend UpdateQuestionDto:\n   - title → text (property name change)\n   - questionType → type (property name change)\n   - description → helpText (property name change)\n   - Add missing fields: allowDocumentUpload, maxDocuments, requireDocuments, isDeleted\n   - Make required fields actually required\n\nThis should resolve both the Guid conversion errors and validation failures.\nRelates to: US-B1-014 CRITICAL bug fixes\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSfx5f7xqg8FKHXdb5XtpqMK38dUgUCaGBAXgAKCRBXtpqMK38d\nUoMVAQDpBDnyHVSNFAWSZqEnLjY+tAVOhyKnZir2bJNd73hLBwEA6/0Df0GbHx3P\nEkFwjA+Idb3I4NcyYqaqMc4FIDtrGgM=\n=QZ1y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-06-29T08:22:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1676151?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github