ted nested Any() translation problems and solutions\n\nAll critical backend issues now resolved for save/publish workflow.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSfx5f7xqg8FKHXdb5XtpqMK38dUgUCaGA+/wAKCRBXtpqMK38d\nUhwKAP9FKmqusNSdBs9itmrG5jBE0RJ++WWNGJ/j4zHWOtMLNwEAs0GHeTLXms9r\n1XZWzDqMYzMpFqUNYNF2G6Ig/axPkQQ=\n=QpQt\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-06-29T08:22:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1676151?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcocastellani","id":1676151,"login":"marcocastellani","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzYxNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/commit/d27a900ee8eabba82e55ab2fd570b32591358fe2","node_id":"C_kwDOO8KSo9oAKGQyN2E5MDBlZThlYWJiYTgyZTU1YWIyZmQ1NzBiMzI1OTEzNThmZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/commit/2e3862fc6fdab322a450dd2e275ea08165982a83","sha":"2e3862fc6fdab322a450dd2e275ea08165982a83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/commits/2e3862fc6fdab322a450dd2e275ea08165982a83"}],"sha":"d27a900ee8eabba82e55ab2fd570b32591358fe2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/commits/d27a900ee8eabba82e55ab2fd570b32591358fe2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1676151?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcocastellani","id":1676151,"login":"marcocastellani","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzYxNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/commits/2e3862fc6fdab322a450dd2e275ea08165982a83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-28T19:13:24Z","email":"marcocastellani@hotmail.com","name":"Marco Castellani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-28T19:13:24Z","email":"marcocastellani@hotmail.com","name":"Marco Castellani"},"message":"fix(backend): resolve EF Core LINQ translation errors for question conditions\n\n🚨 ISSUE: Complex LINQ queries with nested Any() couldn''t be translated to SQL\nError: ''could not be translated'' in ValidateConditionalLogic and other query handlers\n\nROOT CAUSE: EF Core cannot translate complex nested queries like:\n.Where(c => questions.Any(q => q.Id == c.TriggerQuestionId || q.Id == c.TargetQuestionId))\n\nSOLUTION: Split complex queries into simpler ones:\n1. Extract question IDs into a list first\n2. Use Contains() which EF Core can translate to SQL IN clauses\n\nFiles fixed:\n- TemplateValidationService.cs (line 142)\n- PublishTemplateCommandHandler.cs (line 104)\n- GetDraftQuestionnaireQueryHandler.cs (line 84)\n- GetQuestionnaireTemplateQueryHandler.cs (already fixed)\n\nThis resolves LINQ translation errors during save/publish operations.\nRelates to: US-B1-014 backend optimization","tree":{"sha":"aae994e0982be9ddc4e99639bf757b9ea14abc05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/git/trees/aae994e0982be9ddc4e99639bf757b9ea14abc05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/git/commits/2e3862fc6fdab322a450dd2e275ea08165982a83","verification":{"payload":"tree aae994e0982be9ddc4e99639bf757b9ea14abc05\nparent 79345db2f7b88cab463fc5f7506317aed44cb104\nauthor Marco Castellani <marcocastellani@hotmail.com> 1751138004 +0200\ncommitter Marco Castellani <marcocastellani@hotmail.com> 1751138004 +0200\n\nfix(backend): resolve EF Core LINQ translation errors for question conditions\n\n🚨 ISSUE: Complex LINQ queries with nested Any() couldn''t be translated to SQL\nError: ''could not be translated'' in ValidateConditionalLogic and other query handlers\n\nROOT CAUSE: EF Core cannot translate complex nested queries like:\n.Where(c => questions.Any(q => q.Id == c.TriggerQuestionId || q.Id == c.TargetQuestionId))\n\nSOLUTION: Split complex queries into simpler ones:\n1. Extract question IDs into a list first\n2. Use Contains() which EF Core can translate to SQL IN clauses\n\nFiles fixed:\n- TemplateValidationService.cs (line 142)\n- PublishTemplateCommandHandler.cs (line 104)\n- GetDraftQuestionnaireQueryHandler.cs (line 84)\n- GetQuestionnaireTemplateQueryHandler.cs (already fixed)\n\nThis resolves LINQ translation errors during save/publish operations.\nRelates to: US-B1-014 backend optimization\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSfx5f7xqg8