s/79345db2f7b88cab463fc5f7506317aed44cb104"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1676151?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcocastellani","id":1676151,"login":"marcocastellani","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzYxNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/commits/4734f00b8c7c1f45d3cfab5710b9139cf50af6e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-28T19:02:45Z","email":"marcocastellani@hotmail.com","name":"Marco Castellani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-28T19:02:45Z","email":"marcocastellani@hotmail.com","name":"Marco Castellani"},"message":"fix(templates): property mapping for SaveDraftRequest - fixes 400 Bad Request\n\n🚨 ROOT CAUSE: Property name mismatch between frontend and backend DTOs\n\nBackend SaveDraftCommand expects:\n- ''text'' (not ''title'') for questions\n- ''type'' (not ''questionType'') for question type\n- ''helpText'' (not ''description'') for question description\n- ''isDeleted'' boolean for sections and questions\n- undefined (not temp IDs) for new question IDs\n\nFrontend was sending:\n- Wrong property names causing deserialization failures\n- Temporary string IDs instead of undefined for new questions\n\nFixed:\n- Map question.title → text\n- Map question.questionType → type\n- Map question.description → helpText\n- Add isDeleted: false for all items\n- Send undefined for temporary question/section IDs\n- Add required backend properties (allowDocumentUpload, maxDocuments, etc.)\n\nThis resolves the 400 Bad Request error when saving drafts.\nRelates to: US-B1-014 CRITICAL-4","tree":{"sha":"a6b66b31a9cb8bb4cbd82f6bb89a0f7c494fb510","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/git/trees/a6b66b31a9cb8bb4cbd82f6bb89a0f7c494fb510"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/git/commits/4734f00b8c7c1f45d3cfab5710b9139cf50af6e8","verification":{"payload":"tree a6b66b31a9cb8bb4cbd82f6bb89a0f7c494fb510\nparent ae4dd0b46a9a4114faf6d8f01478217fd80f6a69\nauthor Marco Castellani <marcocastellani@hotmail.com> 1751137365 +0200\ncommitter Marco Castellani <marcocastellani@hotmail.com> 1751137365 +0200\n\nfix(templates): property mapping for SaveDraftRequest - fixes 400 Bad Request\n\n🚨 ROOT CAUSE: Property name mismatch between frontend and backend DTOs\n\nBackend SaveDraftCommand expects:\n- ''text'' (not ''title'') for questions\n- ''type'' (not ''questionType'') for question type\n- ''helpText'' (not ''description'') for question description\n- ''isDeleted'' boolean for sections and questions\n- undefined (not temp IDs) for new question IDs\n\nFrontend was sending:\n- Wrong property names causing deserialization failures\n- Temporary string IDs instead of undefined for new questions\n\nFixed:\n- Map question.title → text\n- Map question.questionType → type\n- Map question.description → helpText\n- Add isDeleted: false for all items\n- Send undefined for temporary question/section IDs\n- Add required backend properties (allowDocumentUpload, maxDocuments, etc.)\n\nThis resolves the 400 Bad Request error when saving drafts.\nRelates to: US-B1-014 CRITICAL-4\n","reason":"valid","signature