lani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcocastellani","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/commits/6638526c509969bb25eb7c3cf65d972aeea1675e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-28T17:35:27Z","email":"marcocastellani@hotmail.com","name":"Marco Castellani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-28T17:35:27Z","email":"marcocastellani@hotmail.com","name":"Marco Castellani"},"message":"feat: enhance QuestionsStep component with option management\n\n- Added functionality to manage question options for SingleChoice and MultiChoice types, including adding, removing, and validating options.\n- Implemented state management for new option inputs and integrated option display within the question configuration.\n- Updated validation logic to ensure at least two options are provided for choice questions, improving user experience during questionnaire creation.\n- Enhanced UI to allow users to add options with unique IDs and labels, providing clear feedback on current options and requirements.\n\nThese changes significantly improve the flexibility and usability of the QuestionsStep component in the questionnaire template workflow.","tree":{"sha":"b598d744bd70ad7c7f12bcc25e507ab7387d6b99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/git/trees/b598d744bd70ad7c7f12bcc25e507ab7387d6b99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcocastellani/supplerPortal/git/commits/6638526c509969bb25eb7c3cf65d972aeea1675e","verification":{"payload":"tree b598d744bd70ad7c7f12bcc25e507ab7387d6b99\nparent ab6d297500e5599d30d0e140866d56bcb21e651f\nauthor Marco Castellani <marcocastellani@hotmail.com> 1751132127 +0200\ncommitter Marco Castellani <marcocastellani@hotmail.com> 1751132127 +0200\n\nfeat: enhance QuestionsStep component with option management\n\n- Added functionality to ma