2toAKDYxZTQ2NDM0YmQ2MzNlMzNmY2FlYzBlZDkyOTQxMjRlNzRlM2MyMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeX/commit/1c3741ec40f70745e746a69bad7dfbb9e2d2bfeb","sha":"1c3741ec40f70745e746a69bad7dfbb9e2d2bfeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/commits/1c3741ec40f70745e746a69bad7dfbb9e2d2bfeb"}],"sha":"61e46434bd633e33fcaec0ed9294124e74e3c204","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/commits/61e46434bd633e33fcaec0ed9294124e74e3c204"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99821070?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev","id":99821070,"login":"izzywdev","node_id":"U_kgDOBfMmDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/commits/1c3741ec40f70745e746a69bad7dfbb9e2d2bfeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T18:09:19Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T18:09:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deploy): pin webapp-mfe to a tag that exists (#76)\n\nghcr.io/izzywdev/fuzex-webapp-mfe:0.1.0 was never published, leaving\nfuzex-fuzex-webapp-mfe in ImagePullBackOff. Pinned to 303e2020069c, the\nnewest tag actually published for that package (verified against GHCR:\n0.1.0 -> HTTP 404, 303e2020069c -> HTTP 200). Also corrected a stale\ncomment that wrongly blamed cluster-wide IPv6 GHCR egress.\n\nIncludes a governance-sync reconcile of managed files and a merge of\nmaster.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: fe3aa738-cb24-4315-a29b-29834ddea892","tree":{"sha":"18bf784b36862f86884b1a47c3b8c7b33bd34417","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/git/trees/18bf784b36862f86884b1a47c3b8c7b33bd34417"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/git/commits/1c3741ec40f70745e746a69bad7dfbb9e2d2bfeb","verification":{"payload":"tree 18bf784b36862f86884b1a47c3b8c7b33bd34417\nparent 4189f3c9e91bc962f6da25ae921bbe68220d89d7\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1788890959 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788890959 +0300\n\nfix(deploy): pin webapp-mfe to a tag that exists (#76)\n\nghcr.io/izzywdev/fuzex-webapp-mfe:0.1.0 was never published, leaving\nfuzex-fuzex-webapp-mfe in ImagePullBackOff. Pinned to 303e2020069c, the\nnewest tag actually published for that package (verified against GHCR:\n0.1.0 -> HTTP 404, 303e2020069c -> HTTP 200). Also corrected a stale\ncomment that wrongly blamed cluster-wide IPv6 GHCR egress.\n\nIncludes a governance-sync reconcile of managed files and a merge of\nmaster.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: fe3aa738-cb24-4315-a29b-29834ddea892","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoE9PCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYg0QAFcGpBZUQq6/yZvtJhUlxbvf\nedkqnXBv2cFtxibLEob4TDTw9V+LWf3cmEw5zEk/TMwtqSJJqjc0Jpu9Ed1FU9Sy\nGm21+GRfILJgyJ2OGsKz3raJYrhjWgqbLRK5sfBQLYaa76LQzqhIfFTqj+W1iele\nvZ8N//8w3sMFuifJk3SykRxKk0L+qhNY6sXFQYE53LyKfDM6faBuf9AVpLFmruSa\nvq0NrrExanmR3+uIZUDgfpDPd8HwHwFN95MxhDj5AP4ZFWhuoW9x4fLV6aoJw7dr\nIiSD2T3NJAEmFspGSGTNGHgpv5miNi4RUSp2J9+sDpMwofBWGTkCLR61018bBG4W\nNwUZDa6bWNjg80/9Oq8kY6wytsdrjDgomQxwJwo