m/u/99821070?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev","id":99821070,"login":"izzywdev","node_id":"U_kgDOBfMmDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/commits/4189f3c9e91bc962f6da25ae921bbe68220d89d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T16:05:39Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T16:05:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(helm): reconcile FuzeX prod federatedMount header (same-origin portal mount) (#64)\n\n## Summary\n\n**Rebuilt on current `master`.** This branch originally carried a full\nFuzeSDLC governance sync + an MFE portal-mount reconciliation. The\ngovernance-sync half is now **superseded** — `master` already carries\nnewer canon (including the `pick-runner` hosted-default budget-fallback\nchooser that resolves the required-checks self-hosted contradiction),\nand the `github-actions` governance bot re-reconciled the managed files\nonto this branch directly. So the branch was reset onto `master` and\nreduced to its one still-valid, human-authored change:\n\n**Reconcile the `values-prod.yaml` header so it stops contradicting the\nenabled block.** The prod overlay''s `federatedMount:` block is `enabled:\ntrue` (`host: app.fuzefront.com`) — the same-origin `/apps/fuzex`\nIngress that makes the MFE load inside the FuzeFront portal, turned on\nacross the family in the 2026-08-26 fleet remount. But the header\ncomment still lumped `federatedMount` in with the standalone `ingress`\nunder \"STILL DEFERRED / stay OFF\" — a stale self-contradiction. This\nsplits them:\n\n- **`federatedMount` → NOW ENABLED**, documented to match the block,\nwith the load-bearing caveat that FuzeX must stay **out** of FuzeFront''s\nprefix-stripping `federatedApps` loop (that loop strips `/apps/fuzex`\nand would 404 every base-pathed chunk of a remote built with `base:\n''/apps/fuzex/''`).\n- **standalone `ingress` → stays OFF** (genuinely deferred: needs\nFuzeInfra DNS + a Cloudflare tunnel rule for a `*.prod` host).\n\n**Comment-only; no functional change** — the `federatedMount` block was\nalready `enabled: true`. `helm template` with the prod overlay renders\nthe `webapp-mfe` Deployment/Service and the `kind: Ingress` on `host:\napp.fuzefront.com` → `path: /apps/fuzex` → `fuzex-fuzex-webapp-mfe`,\nwith the ConfigMap carrying `\"remoteEntry\":\n\"/apps/fuzex/remoteEntry.js\"`.\n\n## Type of change\n\n- [x] Documentation\n- [x] Chore / CI / refactor\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Branch named `feat/…`, `fix/…`, or `chore/…` — session-designated\n`claude/…` branch; conventional commits\n- [x] Commits are **signed** (verified)\n- [x] Rebuilt on current `master` (0 behind); no conflicts\n- [ ] Tests added/updated — N/A (comment-only helm-values change;\nvalidated via `helm template`)\n- [ ] Ready for code-owner review\n\n## Notes\n\n- Dropped from the original branch as superseded/incorrect: the stale\ngovernance-canon copies (master has newer), 8 committed `.pyc` bytecode\nartifacts, and the `FuzeX`→`X` registration rename (`master` keeps\n`\"FuzeX\"` and is green — the rename is unneeded).\n- The governance managed files present on this branch were reconciled by\n`github-actions[bot]` (`chore(governance): reconcile managed files to\nFuzeSDLC v1`), not hand-authored here.\n- Merging this changes prod ingress on `app.fuzefront.com` only in\ndocumentation terms (the value was already live); the deploy itself is\nIzzy''s review-merge.\n\n## Related issues\n\n<!-- none -->\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01HFC8fLjGqbkL1kCTv9T8em\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c9386ca63cae676b7b7b93f5303e5e1a67d730f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/git/trees/1c9386ca63cae676b7b7b93f5303e5e1a67d730f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/git/commits/4189f3c9e91bc962f6da25ae921bbe68220d89d7","verification":{"payload":"tree 1c9386ca63cae676b7b7b93f5303e5e1a67d730f\nparent 1ddd283270eea7f9ccfac9f8a331acca0d6322f5\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1788797139 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788797139 +0300\n\ndocs(helm): reconcile FuzeX prod federatedMount header (same-origin portal mount) (#64)\n\n## Summary\n\n**Rebuilt on current `master`.** This branch originally carried a full\nFuzeSDLC governance sync + an MFE portal-mount reconciliation. The\ngovernance-sync half is now **superseded** — `master` already carries\nnewer canon (including the `pick-runner` hosted-default budget-fallback\nchooser that resolves the required-checks self-hosted contradiction),\nand the `github-actions` governance bot re-reconciled the managed files\nonto this branch directly. So the branch was reset onto `master` and\nreduced to its one still-valid, human-authored change:\n\n**Reconcile the `values-prod.yaml` header so it stops contradicting the\nenabled block.** The prod overlay''s `federatedMount:` block is `enabled:\ntrue` (`host: app.fuzefront.com`) — the same-origin `/apps/fuzex`\nIngress that makes the MFE load inside the FuzeFront portal, turned on\nacross the family in the 2026-08-26 fleet remount. But the header\ncomment still lumped `federatedMount` in with the standalone `ingress`\nunder \"STILL DEFERRED / stay OFF\" — a stale self-contradiction. This\nsplits them:\n\n- **`federatedMount` → NOW ENABLED**, documented to match the block,\nwith the load-bearing caveat that FuzeX must stay **out** of FuzeFront''s\nprefix-stripping `federatedApps` loop (that loop strips `/apps/fuzex`\nand would 404 every base-pathed chunk of a remote built with `base:\n''/apps/fuzex/''`).\n- **standalone `ingress` → stays OFF** (genuinely deferred: needs\nFuzeInfra DNS + a Cloudflare tunnel rule for a `*.prod` host).\n\n**Comment-only; no functional change** — the `federatedMount` block was\nalready `enabled: true`. `helm template` with the prod overlay renders\nthe `webapp-mfe` Deployment/Service and the `kind: Ingress` on `host:\napp.fuzefront.com` → `path: /apps/fuzex` → `fuzex-fuzex-webapp-mfe`,\nwith the ConfigMap carrying `\"remoteEntry\":\n\"/apps/fuzex/remoteEntry.js\"`.\n\n## Type of change\n\n- [x] Documentation\n- [x] Chore / CI / refactor\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Branch named `feat/…`, `fix/…`, or `chore/…` — session-designated\n`claude/…` branch; conventional commits\n- [x] Commits are **signed** (verified)\n- [x] Rebuilt on current `master` (0 behind); no conflicts\n- [ ] Tests added/updated — N/A (comment-only helm-values change;\nvalidated via `helm template`)\n- [ ] Ready for code-owner review\n\n## Notes\n\n- Dropped from the original branch as superseded/incorrect: the stale\ngovernance-canon copies (master has newer), 8 committed `.pyc` bytecode\nartifacts, and the `FuzeX`→`X` registration rename (`master` keeps\n`\"FuzeX\"` and is green — the rename is unneeded).\n- The governance managed files present on this branch were reconciled by\n`github-actions[bot]` (`chore(governance): reconcile managed files to\nFuzeSDLC v1`), not hand-authored here.\n- Merging this changes prod ingress on `app.fuzefront.com` only in\ndocumentation terms (the value was already live); the deploy itself is\nIzzy''s review-merge.\n\n## Related issues\n\n<!-- none -->\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01HFC8fLjGqbkL1kCTv9T8em\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnuDTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1bYQAHoCeSmhkQixETo2TlsHzH4w\n+1oBJQ5JNMmiiE+mhnOX1RqMpsei9B184e0UTs2AoxTy2BiuyYcgBld16uPYGjOn\nIFIOvyq5QUNMMZd3E9fG+9jUsy9RC+Db3pOCtWUIheN74+Sx1B0qDM1VmFE2qJMZ\ncyxuEJEDYb+mgVwGAIhWsywf+vs+8RQmVLUGrwQ+ukU8GhmOyCqCw62uJEN7IaXj\nMFxqCCRMuLURtIxCUzHqZcY5vTzwvTRlNiBbxku9u60QsA4WLBSW9O0W8euMP9Dk\nj4OT9q40qSzGuiOWRMEgVHlGj1tq9gqKjBp6IPe6EWDuNO0RLvNPaZJEPQ/dq0n7\ne1LpBNcYZ6dZhukcWsrLfSwyh/4+QMrA16HFwbWVoYgMH+h6V7+2MnbLspc6VyVW\nn+vQaRANV/F0bNhrN6tvgRgjG7fiuVgQKdHkiYeaFHcsvvo24x3PKOZy2Y2XJU2J\nNjFAuD6ysAXI0/4EaNmv1cX3jdqFdY855j4ai6FFimPyjTSnKAEz7f9/oUZ06agX\nB1tdfcP/rAOYyR2ug7seA7MrPj7JfTfP9Y3g+NRBg7olLgTGH0g28V2QPQRRGCJ1\nVSJB0UnuM78b/o/F44Qug8skc6e/B4NEVJptNtAmZMSibGpC3iZHF9L+ZJlWsmxJ\nQIWgQR14KJYjofyw4W9c\n=4QWn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-07T16:05:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_