m canonical) | none |\n| implementation | self-contained / inlined | `uses:\nizzywdev/FuzeSDLC/.github/workflows/reusable-claude-ci-autofix.yml@main`\n|\n\nThe inlined version exists **specifically** to fix FuzeInfra#758: a\npublic repo cannot resolve a reusable workflow hosted in a private repo.\nSo the deleted file never worked on the public repos, and is redundant\non the private ones.\n\nAlso removes a vendor name from the workflow surface, per the `fuze-*`\nabstraction.\n\nVerified before deletion: `fuze-ci-autofix.yml` is present on **22/22**\nrepos.","tree":{"sha":"20ee7456d806ea79bd175b0afa8411f7466da653","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/git/trees/20ee7456d806ea79bd175b0afa8411f7466da653"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/git/commits/ab3d5356207294a00e1bf034604a6f123bdba47c","verification":{"payload":"tree 20ee7456d806ea79bd175b0afa8411f7466da653\nparent c3253e5f455cd0265396f45650959f0bdd4cbed1\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1788272303 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788272303 +0300\n\nchore(ci): remove the superseded duplicate claude-ci-autofix handler (#70)\n\n`claude-ci-autofix.yml` is a superseded duplicate and is deleted here.\n\nBoth workflows trigger on the **same** event — `workflow_run` over\n`[\"Infrastructure Tests\", \"Helm Chart Validation\", \"Harden Gate\"]`,\n`types: [completed]` — so every CI failure has been invoking two\nresponders.\n\n| | `fuze-ci-autofix.yml` | `claude-ci-autofix.yml` |\n|---|---|---|\n| lines | 216 | 30 |\n| marker | `# fuze:managed` (reconciled from canonical) | none |\n| implementation | self-contained / inlined | `uses:\nizzywdev/FuzeSDLC/.github/workflows/reusable-claude-ci-autofix.yml@main`\n|\n\nThe inlined version exists **specifically** to fix FuzeInfra#758: a\npublic repo cannot resolve a reusable workflow hosted in a private repo.\nSo the deleted file never worked on the public repos, and is redundant\non the private ones.\