"e9576699add77d18567950195292c437743074fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/commits/e9576699add77d18567950195292c437743074fb"}],"sha":"34fe1690e03bd1dc35ad5c56e750c6e7e5592649","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/commits/34fe1690e03bd1dc35ad5c56e750c6e7e5592649"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1236702?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/claude","id":209825114,"login":"claude[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDODIGtWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/commits/e9576699add77d18567950195292c437743074fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T02:41:12Z","email":"209825114+claude[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"claude[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T02:41:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(release): route the prod tag bump through a PR, not a direct push to master (#44)\n\nmaster carries the \"Protect default branch\" ruleset (required PR + review +\n6 required status checks, linear history). bump-prod-values used to PUT the\ntag bump straight to master via the contents API, which that ruleset rejects\noutright (HTTP 409, \"Changes must be made through a pull request\") -- not a\ncredential problem, GH_RELEASE_PAT and GITHUB_TOKEN both have same-repo\ncontents:write and the API accepts either identity fine.\n\nRewires the job to push a release/bump-fuzex-<tag> branch and open a PR\nlabelled auto-merge instead, mirroring governance-sync.yml and\na2a-maintain.yml. GH_RELEASE_PAT stays preferred / GITHUB_TOKEN stays the\nfallback, but the fallback''s guarantee changes: GitHub suppresses new\nworkflow runs triggered by the built-in GITHUB_TOKEN, so a GITHUB_TOKEN-only\nrelease PR will not trigger this repo''s pull_request-gated required checks\nand will sit un-mergeable until a human nudges it or GH_RELEASE_PAT is added\n-- documented inline via ::warning:: rather than silently discovered later.\n\nThis is the release.yml half of #37 (fix/fuzex-release-pr-and-golive),\nrebased onto current master as its own branch: that PR''s values-prod.yaml\nhunk pins an older image tag (dadc6955766e) and duplicates the enabled/\ningress flip #42 (feat/prod-deploy) already carries against current master\nwith the up-to-date tag (6aa1c11f6aff) -- landing both would either conflict\nor regress the tag. #37 predates ~9 days of unrelated backend work that also\nlanded on master since it branched (design-frames-service, packages/identity),\nwhich is why a straight rebase touches 58 files; this recreates only the\nrelease.yml diff cleanly against today''s master instead.\n\nVerified:\n- actionlint .github/workflows/release.yml -- 0 findings (repo-wide\n  actionlint has pre-existing shellcheck notices in 5 unrelated workflows,\n  none introduced here).\n- python3 -c \"import yaml; yaml.safe_load(...)\" -- parses.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GaPa3JgrVNtWrGvqQEAEqv\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3b3f7d7e5dc646582d48307f31f1943b212ee69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/git/trees/b3b3f7d7e5dc646582d48307f31f1943b212ee69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/git/commits/e9576699add77d18567950195292c437743074fb","verification":{"payload":"tree b3b3f7d7e5dc646582d48307f31f1943b212ee69\nparent 359613dc5a8e3209dfff6ee392725848d397d06f\nauthor claude[bot] <209825114+claude[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1787452872 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787452872 +0300\n\nfix(release): route the prod tag bump through a PR, not a direct push to master (#44)\n\nmaster carries the \"Protect default branch\" ruleset (required PR + review +\n6 required status checks, linear history). bump-prod-values used to PUT the\ntag bump straight to master via the contents API, which that ruleset rejects\noutright (HTTP 409, \"Changes must be made through a pull request\") -- not a\ncredential problem, GH_RELEASE_PAT and GITHUB_TOKEN both have same-repo\ncontents:write and the API accepts either identity fine.\n\nRewires the job to push a release/bump-fuzex-<tag> branch and open a PR\nlabelled auto-merge instead, mirroring governance-sync.yml and\na2a-maintain.yml. GH_RELEASE_PAT stays preferred / GITHUB_TOKEN stays the\nfallback, but the fallback''s guarantee changes: GitHub suppresses new\nworkflow runs triggered by the built-in GITHUB_TOKEN, so a GITHUB_TOKEN-only\nrelease PR will not trigger this repo''s pull_request-gated required checks\nand will sit un-mergeable until a human nudges it or GH_RELEASE_PAT is added\n-- documented inline via ::warning:: rather than silently discovered later.\n\nThis is the release.yml half of #37 (fix/fuzex-release-pr-and-golive),\nrebased onto current master as its own branch: that PR''s values-prod.yaml\nhunk pins an older image tag (dadc6955766e) and duplicates the enabled/\ningress flip #42 (feat/prod-deploy) already carries against current master\nwith the up-to-date tag (6aa1c11f6aff) -- landing both would either conflict\nor regress the tag. #37 predates ~9 days of unrelated backend work that also\nlanded on master since it branched (design-frames-service, packages/identity),\nwhich is why a straight rebase touches 58 files; this recreates only the\nrelease.yml diff cleanly against today''s master instead.\n\nVerified:\n- actionlint .github/workflows/release.yml -- 0 findings (repo-wide\n  actionlint has pre-existing shellcheck notices in 5 unrelated workflows,\n  none introduced here).\n- python3 -c \"import yaml; yaml.safe_load(...)\" -- parses.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GaPa3JgrVNtWrGvqQEAEqv\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqil3ICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAG1MQADnh/4fOcP/jS0d9BrNF4Zs1\n24Pnvv64+Uv37N1q7mr4pIIun5bEnXYcXwlUkSQ7ZC5FjFRN8jot0fJizqCKZ1tc\nzk2DOMVWICn8aZ0piNTCD+3waj5WokuFVf+ntb/YEmLKbkxpHGY9Ba0nINZ6rS2w\nQ3sMK+3rVC3GkkSgBKXBieq6yFT7RGxbIFyE/NCy/HLvY2ZToSguE1v3DKC6z6sK\nmhW3BItrgcI49I+xrom9oToyP9EQOptDN7yE8emgzTpdxEOYJYIzbdiLEtHnby4L\n0lb9Idj2SrZ859zmOg6yrRMc0YcH5vDMQiQ+nMiE+zIXIlmcERjQ3ijyymlfC1Rv\n7t8smfAtk5TajYfD1lSg5cPboQZm0C3H4CaEj+prWpm/T7uB3ec3t4GpN18iGUd0\nCd9jFDW3UHNl7CBvalbayxeSzqnrOmkkWxl9ZpXIomEVJo2igqEi+6GXDn1fmUvw\nwGsE00dp1apjNKIQWXjq8BGeSDTCWXdT07ut3wAMUompdyqJorlAzjsDBNlgR6+u\navjkHNKX9v7JF01ZJykX/f6AnVW0AMwsz0J5VwCfNYyV5A9r1WOntwoy/Cf1D2A2\ndhEZayhwOq7+OSMnGY/cw8Xlpkam3Ggj9JLftxpQfkiTqKCDft6Z3KbWPI0rMVBJ\n0c10EeMgCRuFVjSWRKzl\n=g0O3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-23T02:41:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow