189b068d096efa2fab0498922b9a4a57544","sha":"858d0189b068d096efa2fab0498922b9a4a57544","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/commits/858d0189b068d096efa2fab0498922b9a4a57544"}],"sha":"2351f7942c0d313317a59c5be2931e5006b2ca4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/commits/2351f7942c0d313317a59c5be2931e5006b2ca4a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99821070?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev","id":99821070,"login":"izzywdev","node_id":"U_kgDOBfMmDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/commits/858d0189b068d096efa2fab0498922b9a4a57544/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T17:23:22Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T17:23:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(governance): set hardening.deployOnPush=true for FuzeX (#30)\n\n* chore(governance): set hardening.deployOnPush=true for FuzeX\n\nFuzeX ships a real deploy-on-push product surface (design-frames-service:\nrelease.yml builds+bumps the image tag on master push; deploy/argocd/\napplication.yaml syncs it via GitOps). Declaring deployOnPush=true aligns the\ngovernance flag with reality: per the schema (.fuze/repo-manifest.schema.json)\nand governance-nightly, a deploy-on-push repo is never bot-merged — changes\nland via owner review in a deploy window, same posture as FuzeFront.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qg8KtEiKTkK5CTL6eKLjDy\n\n* ci(auto-merge): enforce deployOnPush — never bot-merge a deploy-on-push repo\n\nauto-merge.yml previously enabled auto-merge for any owner/labeled PR without\nreading hardening.deployOnPush, so setting the manifest flag alone was a no-op\non the merge path (a declaration nothing enforced). Read the flag and gate the\nenable step on it: deployOnPush=true => auto-merge is skipped and the PR must be\nmerged manually in a deploy window, matching the schema''s own definition.\n\nCompanion to the manifest flip in this PR. The canonical fix belongs in\nFuzeSDLC''s shared auto-merge.yml so every deploy-on-push repo inherits it;\nflagged for platform-governance.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qg8KtEiKTkK5CTL6eKLjDy\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a00a18313535b211cc257fc5eed91cccd9a1bc60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/git/trees/a00a18313535b211cc257fc5eed91cccd9a1bc60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/git/commits/858d0189b068d096efa2fab0498922b9a4a57544","verification":{"payload":"tree a00a18313535b211cc257fc5eed91cccd9a1bc60\nparent 8f28e15a50a4c13a7183abe353a025dfe57acb25\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1787160202 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787160202 +0300\n\nchore(governance): set hardening.deployOnPush=true for FuzeX (#30)\n\n* chore(governance): set hardening.deployOnPush=true for FuzeX\n\nFuzeX ships a real deploy-on-push product surface (design-frames-service:\nrelease.yml builds+bumps the image tag on master push; deploy/argocd/\napplication.yaml syncs it via GitOps). Declaring deployOnPush=true aligns the\ngovernance flag with reality: per the schema (.fuze/repo-manifest.schema.json)\nand governance-nightly, a deploy-on-push repo is never bot-merged — changes\nland via owner review in a deploy window, same posture as FuzeFront.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qg8KtEiKTkK5CTL6eKLjDy\n\n* ci(auto-merge): enforce deployOnPush — never bot-merge a deploy-on-push repo\n\nauto-merge.yml previously enabled auto-merge for any owner/labeled PR without\nreading hardening.deployOnPush, so setting the manifest flag alone was a no-op\non the merge path (a declaration nothing enforced). Read the flag and gate the\nenable step on it: deployOnPush=true => auto-merge is skipped and the PR must be\nmerged manually in a deploy window, matching the schema''s own definition.\n\nCompanion to the manifest flip in this PR. The canonical fix belongs in\nFuzeSDLC''s shared auto-merge.yml so every deploy-on-push repo inherits it;\nflagged for platform-governance.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qg8KtEiKTkK5CTL6eKLjDy\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqheaKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAozcQADmLuEHFx/Tx72JUnkxYDqnw\nv8EhIX5fpqFe6CLIAE5Q3DfSl/oJOGU0eM13rbW3jsZIqP0j13nqWm6vbNTWahvp\nLQD2LhWLcm7wnDy55iJobXGvLiQmSpnKp5V8ByFlfLAsJl8aexZUJI5k38+qTmHi\nKoh06yyvyo1ImEGmRnkqLVmVIFyCAOZvdYvZS2IVNUE75i0sUHF8BmowyECWxyQx\nUpwM/9iGTot2DaB1auOeTYssVr0mY2BEbmhCw04GCfBPmxjsv+zkWTiBHgWCzKIm\n89vlpKhmJA/TAyvVzWaDnAvS8zIgDMpThgmj0PeOcNrSmO1anL8XooVt+OFsOSC9\n3KaoZ0rOuYGDtfgUm1G4HtptFEOErKl3UG3OqH65z3XdsxQ2QCp0WXzHZq9D7d/v\nbkenUxgegTN3aCPbmPw3yCGOZWlWtxDbomYXAdX3/ZWdAcnEQ/e52DqmsCTFy98o\no0IEig3l86GLuItetk0phIX+01YAz6+aohTEoRAHh7FkTvnOk6EgPDBhUsYmXpmb\nB1oc