by canarying the newly-distributed FUZESDLC_DEPLOY_KEY on ONE repo\nbefore the fleet (FuzeInfra#309), and are now fixed in the hub (FuzeSDLC#49, tag v1.2.0):\n\n  1. The reconciler WROTE workflow files -> `git add -A` staged unpushable\n     .github/workflows/** -> the commit-back push was REJECTED (\"failed to push some refs\"),\n     killing reconciliation even for the agent/framework files it COULD have pushed.\n  2. Workflow drift FAILED the check. 10 drifted workflows in FuzeInfra alone would have made\n     every PR permanently red on something this job structurally cannot remediate -> alarm\n     fatigue -> a bypassed gate.\n\nNew semantics: workflows are DETECT-ONLY (reported as a ::warning::, never written, so per-repo\ncustomisations are never clobbered); only a MISSING manifest-declared agent fails, because that\nis real breakage the bootstrapper fixes deterministically.\n\nThe script half arrives automatically (fetched from the hub at baselineRef). This shim is a\nWORKFLOW file, so governance-sync cannot self-update it — hence this PR.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: 17fb89fd-3579-433b-a6c4-9c9e7f3ec549\n\n* chore(governance): reconcile managed files to FuzeSDLC v1 [skip ci]\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b067cf3a9454fa24a4d27f246e051b84c76c730","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/git/trees/3b067cf3a9454fa24a4d27f246e051b84c76c730"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/git/commits/b6a83bbdc4251b0ddfeb69313c0f661aadd171a2","verification":{"payload":"tree 3b067cf3a9454fa24a4d27f246e051b84c76c730\nparent edc99c48ab8d1218cf7e96bb1947464883819f8f\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1784581141 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784581141 +0300\n\nchore(governance): refresh governance-sync shim to the v1.2.0 template (#16)\n\n* chore(governance): refresh governance-sync shim to the v1.2.0 template\n\nTwo bugs were found by canarying the newly-distributed FUZESDLC_DEPLOY_KEY on ONE repo\nbefore the fleet (FuzeInfra#309), and are now fixed in the hub (FuzeSDLC#49, tag v1.2.0):\n\n  1. The reconciler WROTE workflow files -> `git add -A` staged unpushable\n     .github/workflows/** -> the commit-back push was REJECTED (\"failed to push some refs\"),\n     killing reconciliation even for the agent/framework files it COULD have pushed.\n  2. Workflow drift FAILED the check. 10 drifted workflows in FuzeInfra alone would have made\n     every PR permanently red on something this job structurally cannot remediate -> alarm\n     fatigue -> a bypassed gate.\n\nNew semantics: workflows are DETECT-ONLY (reported as a ::warning::, never written, so per-repo\ncustomisations are never clobbered); only a MISSING manifest-declared agent fails, because that\nis real breakage the bootstrapper fixes deterministically.\n\nThe script half arrives automatically (fetched from the hub at baselineRef). This shim is a\nWORKFLOW file, so governance-sync cannot self-update it — hence this PR.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session-Id: 17fb89fd-3579-433b-a6c4-9c9e7f3ec549\n\n* chore(governance): reconcile managed files to FuzeSDLC v1 [skip ci]\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXowVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIqEQAJGUmxRDZFAwpwyE5rOGzRH1\ndokVShE3dR3ceNmKYBRW526I6AbFyywJezDGaeCO65hbw4RZN85kVqXnqZ6NJean\nLsB8HnTcyikTgh02qylVpMWeXrqPiVTNPckfHuz32W/vuIKJlnnSDzgJRRGRPnzv\n0hEYRtARjJxFCPe9pFVq85J5VaAy4LdRa7/Qf9q34vvUWuCO3p5nAu9qV7FNK8pK\ntW5ipnAR0e6oG8p0AuyyPYmfml805unG7MpNxs+frpJvbasg/enkuqnWDNmKKtVr\nXD6BXQT/uQHogbcn4/0RKHrcSwl+nOYL3q5c+CD6TqvDI3Dd0SXXhwy+jFlb