rs/izzywdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev","id":99821070,"login":"izzywdev","node_id":"U_kgDOBfMmDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/commits/af9d86a0ed4a5e3db5d9934582328bb286cb8e7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:21:15Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:21:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(governance): onboard governance-sync + publish-expert (#9)\n\nIncremental FuzeSDLC bootstrap (scripts/sdlc-bootstrap.sh). Adds only what was missing:\n\n- governance-sync.yml — every PR reconciles this repo''s managed files (the manifest''s agent\n  subset + the agent-templates framework) against the FuzeSDLC canonical at its baselineRef,\n  so no PR merges against stale policy. SELF-CONTAINED (no cross-repo `uses:`, which cannot\n  resolve against the private FuzeSDLC and would red the whole run). Skips with a notice\n  until the read-only FUZESDLC_DEPLOY_KEY secret is set — it cannot break CI.\n- publish-expert.yml — publishes THIS repo''s own <repo>-expert to the FuzeSDLC hub as an\n  agent-sync PR on merge to main, so consuming repos stop carrying drifting hand-copies.\n  Skips until FUZESDLC_AGENT_PUSH_TOKEN is set.\n\nBoth are inert until their secrets exist. See FuzeSDLC governance/agent-ownership.md.\n\n\nClaude-Session-Id: 17fb89fd-3579-433b-a6c4-9c9e7f3ec549\n\nCo-authored-by: fuzeone-bot <fuzeone-bot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"52eb01d4a117b0bcd89e5055c03b817e30934e39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/git/trees/52eb01d4a117b0bcd89e5055c03b817e30934e39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/git/commits/af9d86a0ed4a5e3db5d9934582328bb286cb8e7a","verification":{"payload":"tree 52eb01d4a117b0bcd89e5055c03b817e30934e39\nparent 14dc1769780d72f75bcf5bf2ffb99c3c122af0fb\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1784276475 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784276475 +0300\n\nchore(governance): onboard governance-sync + publish-expert (#9)\n\nIncremental FuzeSDLC bootstrap (scripts/sdlc-bootstrap.sh). Adds only what was missing:\n\n- governance-sync.yml — every PR reconciles this repo''s managed files (the manifest''s agent\n  subset + the agent-templates framework) against the FuzeSDLC canonical at its baselineRef,\n  so no PR merges against stale policy. SELF-CONTAINED (no cross-repo `uses:`, which cannot\n  resolve against the private FuzeSDLC and would red the whole run). Skips with a notice\n  until the read-only FUZESDLC_DEPLOY_KEY secret is set — it cannot break CI.\n- publish-expert.yml — publishes THIS repo''s own <repo>-expert to the FuzeSDLC hub as an\n  agent-sync PR on merge to main, so consuming repos stop carrying drifting hand-copies.\n  Skips until FUZESDLC_AGENT_PUSH_TOKEN is set.\n\nBoth are inert until their secrets exist. See FuzeSDLC governance/agent-ownership.md.\n\n\nClaude-Session-Id: 17fb89fd-3579-433b-a6c4-9c9e7f3ec549\n\nCo-authored-by: fuzeone-bot <fuzeone-bot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWeX7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATboQAE1vJaZpq7dSnh50XHpY4ZoU\niO+FdNceiYEw67sktOmQnkme6TJc9TNtSqAqBNyT+lCrycMubkPivdZWLWiu