"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/commits/14dc1769780d72f75bcf5bf2ffb99c3c122af0fb"}],"sha":"af9d86a0ed4a5e3db5d9934582328bb286cb8e7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/commits/af9d86a0ed4a5e3db5d9934582328bb286cb8e7a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99821070?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/fuzeone-bot","id":297101864,"login":"fuzeone-bot[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOEbVqKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuzeone-bot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/commits/14dc1769780d72f75bcf5bf2ffb99c3c122af0fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T12:05:44Z","email":"297101864+fuzeone-bot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"fuzeone-bot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T12:05:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(appsec): enforce localhost-bind + per-session bearer token on all routes (#8)\n\nResolves #7. All findings from the authN/authZ audit addressed:\n\nCRITICAL [C1] Bind server to 127.0.0.1 only (was 0.0.0.0).\nCRITICAL [C2] Per-session bearer token (crypto.randomBytes(32)) required on\n  every route except GET /health. Constant-time comparison (timingSafeEqual)\n  prevents timing oracle.\nCRITICAL [C3] CORS Access-Control-Allow-Origin restricted to localhost origins\n  (allowlist of regex patterns); wildcard ''*'' removed.\nCRITICAL [C4] manifest.json allowedDomains narrowed to localhost/127.0.0.1;\n  wildcard ''*'' removed.\n\nHIGH [H1] GET /plugin/get-requests gated behind bearer token (same session\n  gate = same plugin). Request queue only accessible to the authenticated caller.\nHIGH [H2] POST /plugin/send-response validates requestId exists in\n  pendingPluginRequests before resolving; 404 for unknown ids, 400 for\n  malformed/empty ids. Prevents cross-client response injection.\nHIGH [H3] POST /plugin/connect requires bearer token; spoofed plugin connections\n  rejected before figmaConnected flag is toggled.\n\nMEDIUM [M1] JSON-RPC 2.0 envelope schema-validated (validateMcpEnvelope) before\n  any field access. request.params guarded before dereferencing .name.\nMEDIUM [M2] Request body capped at 64 KB (readBody + drain-not-destroy so\n  clients receive 413 rather than a socket hang-up).\n\nArchitecture note: FuzeX is a localhost-only developer tool. Loopback-bind\n+ per-session token IS the authN boundary for this classification; no\nFuzeFront OIDC/Authentik integration is required or appropriate here.\n\nTests: tests/bridge-server-security.test.cjs — 39 unit + integration tests,\nall green (node tests/bridge-server-security.test.cjs).\n\n\nClaude-Session-Id: 3e74b11c-1ef4-4ac2-b3f0-d8e69b820aa5\n\nCo-authored-by: fuzeone-bot <fuzeone-bot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23dfacb4d6a259bdc0e96c68a803325c59f0e62b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/git/trees/23dfacb4d6a259bdc0e96c68a803325c59f0e62b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeX/git/commits/14dc1769780d72f75bcf5bf2ffb99c3c122af0fb","verification":{"payload":"tree 23dfacb4d6a259bdc0e96c68a803325c59f0e62b\nparent 931db8f688fd5e4a3a692b203ed285c9b62f005f\nauthor fuzeone-bot[bot] <297101864+fuzeone-bot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1782821144 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782821144 +0300\n\nfix(appsec): enforce localhost-bind + per-session bearer token on all routes (#8)\n\nResolves #7. All findings from the authN/authZ audit addressed:\n\nCRITICAL [C1] Bind server to 127.0.0.1 only (was 0.0.0.0).\nCRITICAL [C2] Per-session bearer token (crypto.randomBytes(32)) required on\n  every route except GET /health. Constant-time comparison (timingSafeEqual)\n  prevents timing oracle.\nCRITICAL [C3] CORS Access-Control-Allow-Origin restricted to localhost origins\n  (allowlist of regex patterns); wildcard ''*'' removed.\nCRITICAL [C4] manifest.json allowedDomains narrowed to localhost/127.0.0.1;\n  wildcard ''*'' removed.\n\nHIGH [H1] GET /plugin/get-requests gated behind bearer token (same session\n  gate = same plugin). Request queue only accessible to the authenticated caller.\nHIGH [H2] POST /plugin/send-response validates requestId exists in\n  pendingPluginRequests before resolving; 404 for unknown ids, 400 for\n  malformed/empty ids. Prevents cross-client response injection.\nHIGH [H3] POST /plugin/connect requires bearer token; spoofed plugin connections\n  rejected before figmaConnected flag is toggled.\n\nMEDIUM [M1] JSON-RPC 2.0 envelope schema-validated (validateMcpEnvelope) before\n  any field access. request.params guarded before dereferencing .name.\nMEDIUM [M2] Request body capped at 64 KB (readBody + drain-not-destroy so\n  clients receive 413 rather than a socket hang-up).\n\nArchitecture note: FuzeX is a localhost-only developer tool. Loopback-bind\n+ per-session token IS the authN boundary for this classification; no\nFuzeFront OIDC/Authentik integration is required or appropriate here.\n\nTests: tests/bridge-server-security.test.cjs — 39 unit + integration tests,\nall green (node tests/bridge-server-security.test.cjs).\n\n\nClaude